The Project Files section contains all the necessary files required for “ToyCraft Tales: Tableau's Vision into Toy Manufacturer Data.”

It includes the dataset (CSV/Excel), SQL scripts for database creation and queries, Tableau workbook file (.twb/.twbx), and project documentation.

These files collectively support data storage, analysis, visualization, and final dashboard presentation.

Proper organization of project files ensures easy access, maintenance, and smooth project execution.
